{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_st02","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_st02","title":"一日之禍","storyCode":"WR-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"67dc7c50568e782a5f64a81f5e11cacecf3b792f3a65fb51b79a2c8477aa469e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"災難過後的婆山鎮哀鴻遍野，儘管炎熔一行幫忙重建城鎮，見到此情此景，也難掩失落。另一面，神色古怪的說書人找到黎，黎卻反過來，給他說了一段書。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"往這！往這邊來點，對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你幫我把那門釘上，拿穩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有人看見我們家老三，有沒有人看見我們家老三呐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你有沒有看見我們家的老三？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，小僧未曾見過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小余，小余，你在哪兒啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，叔叔給你買糖吃，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔帶你看煙火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......你媽媽要是在，也不會想看到小阿然不吃不喝的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......媽媽啊啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，哭吧，哭出來，總比悶在心裡要好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有，這孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人......這孩子叫阿然，聽說她父親早早離鄉尋工，再也沒回來。昨天的事，又不見了母親，一直恍恍惚惚的，到了今天也不吃不喝呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！恩人呐，您可別擺出那副臉色，要不是您和克洛絲二位，這鎮上，還不得生靈塗炭啊，俗話說得好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，俗話哪管用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，我們現在該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到黎和那個說書的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"他們明顯知道些什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......稀客。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你認得我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"婥園之主，煮傘先生，這婆山鎮，誰人不知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"您這位說書先生，繼承了那位大商的園子，可不就是婆山鎮的老天爺嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"先生請坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這就要走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"今日先生倒真是沉默......不過，請先留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"平時都是您給大家說書解悶，只收些象徵性的茶水錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不如今天，讓我來給先生說段故事，而且不收茶錢，白送這碗茶水。不知先生意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"今天要講的故事，可比先生搜羅來的那些志怪小說，要簡單得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"話說數十年前，大炎東南邊陲，有一處名叫婆山鎮的鎮子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你繼續吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這座婆山鎮，平平無奇。鎮上不過百來戶人家，靠山吃山，日子過得樸實。偶爾會有商隊路過，那個日子，就是孩子們狂歡的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"而就是這樣一個小鎮，卻在某一日，遭遇了天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"天災沒有徹底毀了這座小鎮，但活性源石污染了水源。大人們想向附近的城邦求援，但鎮上沒有信使，離開鎮子的大人，又全部杳無音訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，被迫無奈地，人們拋棄了這座城鎮，開始了漫無目的的旅途——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上其實沒人知道該去哪裡，他們甚至對最近的城市都一無所知，就像聽天由命一樣，他們選了一個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"對於那些孩子而言，溫暖的床榻，曲折的籬笆，牆上風趣的水漬，突然就全部變成了伸手不見五指的夜晚，還有一條......很長的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這條路上，餓死了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"有個孩子，她年歲不大，家境貧寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她跟著她的父母走著，看著那些親密無間的鄰里變得少言寡語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"看著那些一起玩耍的哥哥姐姐，為了半塊發黴的燒餅，就用尖銳的石子互相毆打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她想，也許事情會好起來的。她也努力了，去找漿果，找小動物，去抓河裡的鱗獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她還險些因為抓鱗獸而溺死在河裡，也幾次因為饑餓而失去意識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"也許只是造化弄人，也許她身邊的至親突然意識到，這個瘦削的小丫頭最後的用處，就是為他們省下一些口糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"當她捧著不知能不能入口的山果回“家”時，那裡已經空無一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"寒夜峭壁間的獸鳴提醒了她，她的生命一文不值。她在恍惚間仿佛天人感應一般，每寸肌膚都在向她描繪死亡的溫度，然後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她見到了一個人。一個......奇妙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"那話怎麼說來著？哦......欲知後事如何，且聽下回分解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"總是在這個時候吊人胃口，真是壞心眼，先生難得像普通人一樣嘗嘗這滋味，感覺如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，掌櫃的，小僧找你好久啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔？先生何故在此？方才一場大難，大夥可都在擔心你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼......只是在這裡走走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？小僧在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"在畫中久矣，點到為止，差不多得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你何苦也費力去撈水中月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"眾人皆醉，你獨醒，卻還要裝醉，反而很不討喜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"您不是那說書先生......您就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"好自為之罷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯的扇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這不是克洛絲恩人嗎，怎麼突然闖進來了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這次大傢伙都遭了殃啦，沒事，我會和兩位恩人一起幫忙重建園子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你真的只是一個普通的信使，不過我還是得提醒你一句......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這個情況，如果你仍然要堅持互相保留......我們也只好放棄對你的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人呐！你在說什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯的扇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"炎國功夫各式各樣，雖然我不是專家，不過你身手不差......相當不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你隱藏身手肯定是有自己的苦衷吧，這個我不打算刨根問底就是啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是我並不喜歡明明有能力出手相助，卻要給自己找藉口畏首畏尾的行為哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴格說來，這很自私吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，雖然話說得很重，不過你還是有救下阿然的嘛，不用太愧疚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，恩人。二位救了我，我理當全盤托出才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人原來......早就看穿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，只是看你裝模作樣還挺有趣的而已嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......等從這裡逃出去，我會給二位恩人一個交代的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那說好了喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人......我在想一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，在這園子裡恍然大悟前，我們到底在這座不尋常的鎮子上......困了多久？完全沒印象......也就是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"離我們在那灰齊山上推門而入，到底過了多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
